return ['domain'=>'zinn-connector','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'sw','project-id-version'=>'zinn-connector','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-10-01T20:50:35+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-10-01T20:50:35+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Connector'=>'Zinn® Connector','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-connector'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-connector','Connects this WordPress site to Zinn Digital® so scheduled articles can be published to it. Paste a pairing code from your Zinn® dashboard and the plugin sets up its own credential — nothing is copied by hand.'=>'Inaunganisha tovuti hii ya WordPress kwenye Zinn Digital® ili makala zilizoratibiwa ziweze kuchapishwa humo. Bandika msimbo wa kuoanisha kutoka kwenye dashibodi yako ya Zinn® na programu-jalizi itaweka kitambulisho chake yenyewe — hakuna kinachonakiliwa kwa mikono.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Stored. Type a new value to replace it.'=>'Imehifadhiwa. Andika thamani mpya ili kuibadilisha.','Filter this list…'=>'Chuja orodha hii…','Filter this list'=>'Chuja orodha hii','Nothing matches that filter.'=>'Hakuna kinacholingana na kichujio hicho.','Add a row'=>'Ongeza safu mlalo','Remove this row'=>'Ondoa safu mlalo hii','Remove'=>'Ondoa','Zinn Digital®'=>'Zinn Digital®','Zinn Digital® — overview'=>'Zinn Digital® — muhtasari','Overview'=>'Muhtasari','Copied'=>'Imenakiliwa','Every Zinn® plugin on this site, and whether it is working.'=>'Kila programu-jalizi ya Zinn® kwenye tovuti hii, na ikiwa inafanya kazi.','No connection is needed for this plugin.'=>'Hakuna muunganisho unaohitajika kwa programu-jalizi hii.','Open settings'=>'Fungua mipangilio','You do not have permission to change these settings.'=>'Huna ruhusa ya kubadilisha mipangilio hii.','Settings sections'=>'Sehemu za mipangilio','Support'=>'Usaidizi','Save changes'=>'Hifadhi mabadiliko','Tools'=>'Zana','Export settings'=>'Hamisha mipangilio','Reset to defaults'=>'Rejesha kwenye chaguomsingi','This puts every setting on this plugin back to its default. Continue?'=>'Hii itarejesha kila mpangilio kwenye programu-jalizi hii hadi kwenye chaguo-msingi. Je, ungependa kuendelea?','Diagnostics for support'=>'Uchunguzi kwa ajili ya usaidizi','Import a settings file'=>'Leta faili la mipangilio','Import'=>'Leta ndani','Exported files never contain passwords, tokens or API keys — you will need to enter those again on the new site.'=>'Faili zilizohamishwa hazina manenosiri, tokeni au vitufe vya API kamwe — utahitaji kuviingiza tena kwenye tovuti mpya.','Settings saved.'=>'Mipangilio imehifadhiwa.','Every setting on this plugin is back to its default.'=>'Kila mpangilio kwenye programu-jalizi hii umerudi kwenye chaguomsingi yake.','Done.'=>'Imekamilika.','That action is not available.'=>'Kitendo hicho hakipatikani.','That file could not be read. Choose a settings file exported from a Zinn® plugin.'=>'Faili hiyo haikuweza kusomwa. Chagua faili ya mipangilio iliyohamishwa kutoka kwenye programu-jalizi ya Zinn®.','That file is too large to be a settings export.'=>'Faili hilo ni kubwa mno kuwa faili la kuhamisha mipangilio.','That file is not a Zinn® settings export.'=>'Faili hilo si faili la uhamishaji wa mipangilio ya Zinn®.','That file was exported from a different plugin (%s), so importing it here would store settings this plugin does not understand.'=>'Faili hilo lilihamishwa kutoka kwa programu-jalizi tofauti (%s), kwa hivyo kuliingiza hapa kutahifadhi mipangilio ambayo programu-jalizi hii haielewi.','%d setting imported. Passwords and API keys are never in an export, so enter those again.'=>'Mipangilio %d imeagizwa. Manenosiri na funguo za API huwa hazipo kwenye faili la kuhamisha, kwa hivyo ziingize tena.' . "\0" . 'Mipangilio %d imeagizwa. Nenosiri na funguo za API haziwahi kuwepo kwenye faili lililohamishwa, kwa hivyo ziingize tena.','The archive would be %1$d MB, over the %2$d MB limit set on this site. Raise the limit, or exclude some folders, on the Zinn Digital® → Connector → Backups screen.'=>'Kumbukumbu ingekuwa na ukubwa wa MB %1$d, zaidi ya kikomo cha MB %2$d kilichowekwa kwenye tovuti hii. Ongeza kikomo, au tenga baadhi ya folda, kwenye skrini ya Zinn Digital® → Connector → Backups.','This site\'s PHP cannot create archives, so a backup could not be made.'=>'PHP ya tovuti hii haiwezi kuunda kumbukumbu, kwa hivyo nakala rudufu haikuweza kutengenezwa.','Could not create a temporary file.'=>'Haikuweza kuunda faili ya muda.','This site\'s files could not be archived.'=>'Faili za tovuti hii hazikuweza kuwekwa kwenye kumbukumbu.','This site\'s PHP cannot compress archives, so a backup could not be made.'=>'PHP ya tovuti hii haiwezi kubana kumbukumbu, kwa hivyo nakala rudufu haikuweza kutengenezwa.','A backup of this site needs about %1$s of temporary space and only %2$s is free, so it was not attempted.'=>'Hifadhi rudufu ya tovuti hii inahitaji takriban %1$s ya nafasi ya muda na ni %2$s pekee iliyo wazi, kwa hivyo haikujaribiwa.','This WordPress user cannot publish posts, so a connection made now could not publish either. Sign in as a user who can, and try again.'=>'Mtumiaji huyu wa WordPress hawezi kuchapisha machapisho, kwa hivyo muunganisho uliofanywa sasa hauwezi kuchapisha pia. Ingia kama mtumiaji anayeweza, kisha ujaribu tena.','Application passwords are turned off on this site, so we cannot create a credential. Ask your host to enable them, or connect the site with a password you create yourself in your Zinn Digital® dashboard.'=>'Nywila za programu zimezimwa kwenye tovuti hii, kwa hivyo hatuwezi kuunda kitambulisho. Muombe mtoa huduma wako wa upangishaji aziwashe, au unganisha tovuti hiyo kwa nywila unayounda mwenyewe kwenye dashibodi yako ya Zinn Digital®.','WordPress would not create a credential for this site. Nothing has been sent anywhere.'=>'WordPress haikuweza kuunda kitambulisho cha tovuti hii. Hakuna chochote kilichotumwa popote.','We could not reach Zinn Digital® from this site. Nothing was connected, and the credential we made has been removed. Check the site can make outgoing requests, and try again.'=>'Hatuwezi kuwasiliana na Zinn Digital® kutoka kwa tovuti hii. Hakuna kilichounganishwa, na kitambulisho tulichotengeneza kimeondolewa. Hakikisha tovuti inaweza kutuma maombi ya nje, kisha ujaribu tena.','Zinn Digital® could not finish connecting this site. The problem is on our side, not with your pairing code — nothing was connected, and the credential we made has been removed. The same pairing code still works: try again in a few minutes.'=>'Zinn Digital® haikuweza kukamilisha kuunganisha tovuti hii. Tatizo liko upande wetu, si kwenye msimbo wako wa kuoanisha — hakuna kilichounganishwa, na kitambulisho tulichotengeneza kimeondolewa. Msimbo uleule wa kuoanisha bado unafanya kazi: jaribu tena baada ya dakika chache.','Zinn Digital® did not accept that pairing code. Nothing was connected. Generate a fresh code in your dashboard and try again.'=>'Zinn Digital® haikukubali msimbo huo wa kuoanisha. Hakuna kilichounganishwa. Tengeneza msimbo mpya kwenye dashibodi yako na ujaribu tena.','Connected. Zinn Digital® can now publish to this site.'=>'Imeunganishwa. Zinn Digital® sasa inaweza kuchapisha kwenye tovuti hii.','Connected'=>'Imeunganishwa','Connecting…'=>'Inaunganisha…','Connected, but something needs attention'=>'Imeunganishwa, lakini kuna jambo linalohitaji uangalizi','Not connected'=>'Haijaunganishwa','Running on your own account'=>'Inatumika kwenye akaunti yako mwenyewe','We could not check this'=>'Hatukuweza kuangalia hili','This plugin did not say why. Send a diagnostics report and we will look.'=>'Programu-jalizi hii haikueleza sababu. Tuma ripoti ya uchunguzi nasi tutaiangalia.','Connection status'=>'Hali ya muunganisho','Last checked %s ago.'=>'Ilikaguliwa mara ya mwisho %s zilizopita.','(opens in a new tab)'=>'(hufunguka katika kichupo kipya)','Send this to Zinn® support'=>'Tuma hii kwa usaidizi wa Zinn®','This is exactly what will be sent — nothing else, and nothing hidden. Your passwords, tokens and API keys are not in it.'=>'Hiki ndicho hasa kitakachotumwa — hakuna kingine, na hakuna kilichofichwa. Nywila zako, tokeni na vitufe vya API havimo.','The diagnostics report that will be sent'=>'Ripoti ya uchunguzi itakayotumwa','Copy to clipboard'=>'Nakili kwenye ubao wa kunakili','Send this report to Zinn® support'=>'Tuma ripoti hii kwa usaidizi wa Zinn®','We open a support ticket for you and reply by email. If you would rather not send it, copy it above and paste it into a ticket yourself.'=>'Tunakufungulia tiketi ya usaidizi na kujibu kwa barua pepe. Ikiwa ungependelea kutoituma, inakili hapo juu na uibandike mwenyewe kwenye tiketi.','We could not reach Zinn Digital® from this server (%s). Copy the report above and open a ticket instead — nothing about your settings is wrong.'=>'Hatuwezi kufikia Zinn Digital® kutoka kwa seva hii (%s). Nakili ripoti iliyo hapo juu na ufungue tiketi badala yake — hakuna hitilafu yoyote kwenye mipangilio yako.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report and will reply by email.'=>'Imetumwa. Dawati la usaidizi la Zinn® limepokea ripoti yako na litajibu kupitia barua pepe.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report — reference %s — and will reply by email.'=>'Imetumwa. Usaidizi wa Zinn® umepokea ripoti yako — rejeleo %s — na utajibu kwa barua pepe.','You have sent several reports in a short time. Wait a few minutes and try again — the earlier ones did arrive.'=>'Umetuma ripoti kadhaa kwa muda mfupi. Subiri dakika chache kisha ujaribu tena — ripoti za awali zimefika.','Zinn Digital® could not accept the report just now — that is our end, not yours. Try again shortly, or copy the report above into a ticket.'=>'Zinn Digital® haikuweza kupokea ripoti sasa hivi — hilo ni tatizo la upande wetu, si wako. Jaribu tena hivi karibuni, au nakili ripoti iliyo hapo juu kwenye tiketi.','The report was refused (HTTP %d). Copy it above and open a ticket, quoting that number.'=>'Ripoti ilikataliwa (HTTP %d). Inakili hapo juu na ufungue tiketi, ukitaja nambari hiyo.','This site’s owner has turned off image uploads for Zinn Digital® in the Zinn® Connector settings.'=>'Mmiliki wa tovuti hii amezima upakiaji wa picha kwa ajili ya Zinn Digital® katika mipangilio ya Zinn® Connector.','This site’s owner has turned off edits to existing articles for Zinn Digital® in the Zinn® Connector settings.'=>'Mmiliki wa tovuti hii amezima uhariri wa makala yaliyopo kwa ajili ya Zinn Digital® katika mipangilio ya Zinn® Connector.','New article on your site: %s'=>'Makala mapya kwenye tovuti yako: %s','Zinn Digital® has added an article to your site.

Title: %1$s
Edit it: %2$s
Status: %3$s

Turn these emails off on the Zinn Digital® → Connector → Publishing screen.'=>'Zinn Digital® imeongeza makala kwenye tovuti yako.

Kichwa: %1$s
Ihariri: %2$s
Hali: %3$s

Zima barua pepe hizi kwenye skrini ya Zinn Digital® → Kiunganishi → Uchapishaji.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — miongozo na huduma','User guides'=>'Miongozo ya mtumiaji','Read the %s user guide'=>'Soma mwongozo wa mtumiaji wa %s','Hide this'=>'Ficha hii','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Ukaribishaji wa Zinn® kwa WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, nakala rudufu za kila siku, uhamishaji wa bila malipo na paneli dhibiti iliyoundwa kwa ajili ya watu wanaoendesha zaidi ya tovuti moja.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Soko la Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Nunua na uuze tovuti zilizothibitiwa, vikoa na nafasi za viungo, huku pesa zikiwekwa salama hadi pande zote mbili zitakapoidhinisha.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — ajiri watu ambao hii ndiyo kazi yao ya kujipatia riziki','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Soko letu la kimataifa la wafanyakazi huru: vinjari zaidi ya huduma 10,000 zilizotengenezwa tayari kutoka kwa waandishi, wabunifu, wasanidi programu na wataalamu wa SEO, au chapisha mradi na uwape nafasi ya kutoa zabuni.','Connector'=>'Kiunganishi','Connection'=>'Muunganisho','Publishing'=>'Inachapisha','Backups'=>'Nakala rudufu','Advanced'=>'Ya juu','Check the connection now'=>'Angalia muunganisho sasa','Disconnect this site'=>'Tenganisha tovuti hii','This revokes the credential Zinn Digital® uses, so we can no longer publish to this site. Anything already published stays. Continue?'=>'Hii inabatilisha kitambulisho kinachotumiwa na Zinn Digital®, kwa hivyo hatuwezi tena kuchapisha kwenye tovuti hii. Chochote ambacho tayari kimechapishwa kinabaki. Je, ungependa kuendelea?','What we may do on this site'=>'Tunachoweza kufanya kwenye tovuti hii','The credential we hold is an ordinary WordPress application password, so WordPress itself decides what is possible. These narrow it further, on your side.'=>'Kitambulisho tunachoshikilia ni nenosiri la kawaida la programu ya WordPress, kwa hivyo WordPress yenyewe huamua kile kinachowezekana. Hizi zinaipunguza zaidi, kwa upande wako.','Publish articles as'=>'Chapisha makala kama','Choose “a draft” if you would rather read everything before it goes live.'=>'Chagua "rasimu" ikiwa ungependelea kusoma kila kitu kabla ya kuchapishwa.','Published straight away'=>'Imechapishwa mara moja','A draft, for me to review'=>'Rasimu, ya mimi kukagua','Pending review'=>'Inasubiri ukaguzi','Scheduled, using the date we send'=>'Imepangwa, kwa kutumia tarehe tunayotuma','Show the author as'=>'Onyesha mwandishi kama','Which of your users appears as the author. This does not change who we sign in as.'=>'Ni yupi kati ya watumiaji wako anayeonekana kama mwandishi. Hii haibadilishi akaunti tunayoingia kwayo.','Put articles in'=>'Weka makala ndani ya','Allow images'=>'Ruhusu picha','Let Zinn Digital® upload images into this site’s media library'=>'Ruhusu Zinn Digital® kupakia picha kwenye maktaba ya media ya tovuti hii','Turn this off and articles arrive without their images. Nothing already uploaded is removed.'=>'Zima hii na makala zitawasili bila picha zake. Hakuna chochote kilichokwisha kupakiwa kitakachoondolewa.','Allow edits'=>'Ruhusu uhariri','Let Zinn Digital® update an article it published before'=>'Ruhusu Zinn Digital® isasishe makala iliyochapisha hapo awali','Used for corrections and re-optimisation. It never touches anything you wrote yourself.'=>'Hutumika kwa masahihisho na uboreshaji upya. Haibadilishi chochote ulichokiandika wewe mwenyewe.','Tell me when something is published'=>'Niambie kitu kinapochapishwa','Leave blank for no email. One message per article, from your own site.'=>'Acha wazi ikiwa hutaki barua pepe. Ujumbe mmoja kwa kila makala, kutoka kwa tovuti yako mwenyewe.','Off-site backups'=>'Nakala rudufu za nje ya tovuti','This site sends its own backup straight to Zinn® storage. Nothing passes through our servers on the way.'=>'Tovuti hii hutuma nakala yake ya akiba moja kwa moja kwenye hifadhi ya Zinn®. Hakuna kinachopita kwenye seva zetu njiani.','Back this site up to Zinn Digital®'=>'Hifadhi nakala ya tovuti hii kwenye Zinn Digital®','Backup token'=>'Tokeni ya nakala rudufu','Paste the token shown on this site’s Backups tab in your Zinn Digital® dashboard when you chose the plugin connection. It is shown there only once; saving the connection again issues a new one.'=>'Bandika tokeni iliyoonyeshwa kwenye kichupo cha Nakala rudufu cha tovuti hii kwenye dashibodi yako ya Zinn Digital® ulipochagua muunganisho wa programu-jalizi. Inaonyeshwa hapo mara moja tu; kuhifadhi muunganisho tena kunatoa mpya.','Leave these out'=>'Acha haya nje','One path per line, relative to wp-content — for example <code>cache</code> or <code>uploads/backups</code>. Caches and other backup plugins’ folders are the usual candidates.'=>'Njia moja kwa kila mstari, inayohusiana na wp-content — kwa mfano <code>cache</code> au <code>uploads/backups</code>. Vacheche na folda za programu-jalizi nyingine za nakala rudufu ndizo zinazopendekezwa zaidi.','Stop if the archive would exceed'=>'Acha ikiwa kumbukumbu itazidi','Megabytes. A shared host will usually kill a very large archive part-way; a bound turns that into a message instead of a silent failure.'=>'Megabaiti. Seva inayoshirikiwa kwa kawaida itakatisha kumbukumbu kubwa sana ikiwa njiani; kikomo hugeuza hali hiyo kuwa ujumbe badala ya hitilafu ya kimya kimya.','Detailed logging'=>'Uwekaji kumbukumbu wa kina','Record what this plugin does, for support'=>'Rekodi kile kinachofanywa na programu-jalizi hii, kwa ajili ya usaidizi','Kept on this site, capped at the last 50 entries, and included in a diagnostics report. Turn it on before reproducing a problem.'=>'Huwekwa kwenye tovuti hii, ikipunguzwa kwa maingizo 50 ya mwisho, na kujumuishwa katika ripoti ya uchunguzi. Iwashe kabla ya kutoa tena tatizo.','On uninstall'=>'Wakati wa kusanidua','Delete this plugin’s settings when it is uninstalled'=>'Futa mipangilio ya programu-jalizi hii inapoondolewa','Uninstalling never revokes the application password — that is deliberate, so uninstalling to try something else does not break your publishing. Use Disconnect above if you want the credential gone.'=>'Kuondoa hakubatilishi kamwe nenosiri la programu — hiyo ni kwa makusudi, ili kuondoa ili kujaribu kitu kingine kusiharibu uchapishaji wako. Tumia Tenganisha hapo juu ikiwa unataka kitambulisho kiondolewe.','The user we sign in as'=>'Mtumiaji tunayeingia kama yeye','The site’s default category'=>'Kitengo chaguomsingi cha tovuti','Connect this site again'=>'Unganisha tovuti hii tena','Connect this site'=>'Unganisha tovuti hii','Open your Zinn Digital® dashboard, go to Content → Other sites, and press “Get a pairing code”. Paste it below.'=>'Fungua dashibodi yako ya Zinn Digital®, nenda kwenye Maudhui → Tovuti nyingine, na ubonyeze “Pata msimbo wa kuoanisha”. Bandika hapa chini.','Connecting again creates a fresh credential and leaves the old one in place — use Disconnect first if you want the old one gone.'=>'Kuunganisha tena kunatengeneza kitambulisho kipya na kuacha cha zamani mahali pake — tumia Tenganisha kwanza ikiwa unataka kile cha zamani kiondolewe.','Pairing code'=>'Msimbo wa kuoanisha','It expires thirty minutes after you generate it, and can only be used once.'=>'Muda wake unaisha dakika thelathini baada ya kuizalisha, na inaweza kutumika mara moja tu.','You are not allowed to connect this site.'=>'Huruhusiwi kuunganisha tovuti hii.','This site is not connected to Zinn Digital®.'=>'Tovuti hii haijaunganishwa na Zinn Digital®.','Nothing is wrong — it has simply not been paired yet. Get a pairing code from your Zinn® dashboard and paste it into this plugin’s settings.'=>'Hakuna hitilafu yoyote — haijaunganishwa tu bado. Pata msimbo wa kuoanisha kutoka kwenye dashibodi yako ya Zinn® na ubandike kwenye mipangilio ya programu-jalizi hii.','Open my Zinn® dashboard'=>'Fungua dashibodi yangu ya Zinn®','The connection is broken.'=>'Muunganisho umekatika.','The WordPress user the credential belonged to (%s) no longer exists on this site, so nothing we send can be published. Connect again as a user who can publish.'=>'Mtumiaji wa WordPress ambaye kitambulisho kilikuwa chake (%s) hayupo tena kwenye tovuti hii, kwa hivyo hakuna chochote tunachotuma kinachoweza kuchapishwa. Unganisha tena kama mtumiaji anayeweza kuchapisha.','The “Zinn Digital® (publishing)” application password has been deleted from this site, so we can no longer sign in. Connect again to create a new one — nothing else was lost.'=>'Nenosiri la programu ya “Zinn Digital® (publishing)” limefutwa kwenye tovuti hii, kwa hivyo hatuwezi tena kuingia. Unganisha tena ili kuunda jipya — hakuna kitu kingine kilichopotea.','See this site’s application passwords'=>'Tazama nywila za programu za tovuti hii','Connected, but publishing would fail.'=>'Imeunganishwa, lakini uchapishaji ungeshindwa.','The credential belongs to %s, and that user can no longer publish posts. Sign-in still works, so nothing looks wrong until an article is due. Give that user the ability to publish, or connect again as somebody who can.'=>'Kitambulisho hiki ni cha %s, na mtumiaji huyo hawezi tena kuchapisha machapisho. Kuingia bado kunafanya kazi, kwa hivyo hakuna kinachoonekana kuwa na hitilafu hadi wakati wa makala unapofika. Mpe mtumiaji huyo uwezo wa kuchapisha, au unganisha tena kama mtu anayeweza.','Edit that user'=>'Hariri mtumiaji huyo','Connected here — we could not reach Zinn Digital® to confirm.'=>'Imeunganishwa hapa — hatukuweza kufikia Zinn Digital® ili kuthibitisha.','Connected, but your Zinn® account needs attention.'=>'Imeunganishwa, lakini akaunti yako ya Zinn® inahitaji kushughulikiwa.','Connected to Zinn Digital®.'=>'Imeunganishwa kwenye Zinn Digital®.','Connected to Zinn Digital® as %s.'=>'Imeunganishwa kwenye Zinn Digital® kama %s.','Publishing as'=>'Inachapisha kama','Zinn® site ID'=>'Kitambulisho cha tovuti ya Zinn®','This server could not reach api.zinndigital.com (%s). That is usually a firewall or an outbound-connection rule on your host, not a problem with your Zinn® account — publishing may still be working.'=>'Seva hii haikuweza kufikia api.zinndigital.com (%s). Kawaida hilo ni ngome au sheria ya muunganisho wa kutoka kwenye mpangishaji wako, si tatizo la akaunti yako ya Zinn® — huenda uchapishaji bado unafanya kazi.','Zinn Digital® answered with an error of its own — that is our end, not yours. Publishing is unaffected while this clears.'=>'Zinn Digital® imejibu kwa hitilafu yake yenyewe — hilo ni kutoka upande wetu, si wako. Uchapishaji hautaathiriwa wakati hitilafu hii inatatuliwa.','Your Zinn® account is not currently able to publish to this site. Your dashboard says why.'=>'Akaunti yako ya Zinn® kwa sasa haiwezi kuchapisha kwenye tovuti hii. Dashibodi yako inaeleza sababu.','Zinn Digital® answered HTTP %d, which we do not recognise. Send a diagnostics report from the Support tab and we will look — do not change anything here first.'=>'Zinn Digital® imejibu HTTP %d, ambayo hatuitambui. Tuma ripoti ya utambuzi kutoka kwenye kichupo cha Usaidizi nasi tutaangalia — usibadilishe chochote hapa kwanza.','Check again now'=>'Angalia tena sasa','Checked. The connection is live.'=>'Imekaguliwa. Muunganisho unafanya kazi.','We could not remove the application password, so this site is still connected. Delete “Zinn Digital® (publishing)” on your profile screen and try again — we have changed nothing.'=>'Hatukuweza kuondoa nenosiri la programu, kwa hivyo tovuti hii bado imeunganishwa. Futa “Zinn Digital® (publishing)” kwenye skrini ya wasifu wako kisha ujaribu tena — hatujabadilisha chochote.','Disconnected. The application password has been revoked, so Zinn Digital® can no longer publish to this site. Nothing already published was touched.'=>'Imetenganishwa. Nenosiri la programu limebatilishwa, kwa hivyo Zinn Digital® haiwezi tena kuchapisha kwenye tovuti hii. Hakuna chochote kilichokwisha chapishwa kilichoguswa.','That file could not be read from this server, so nothing was uploaded.'=>'Faili hiyo haikuweza kusomwa kutoka kwa seva hii, kwa hivyo hakuna kilichopakiwa.','This site could not stream the upload, so nothing was sent.'=>'Tovuti hii haikuweza kutiririsha upakiaji, kwa hivyo hakuna kilichotumwa.','This file is %1$s and this site\'s PHP has no cURL, so the largest it can upload is %2$s.'=>'Faili hili lina ukubwa wa %1$s na PHP ya tovuti hii haina cURL, kwa hivyo ukubwa wa juu zaidi unaoweza kupakia ni %2$s.','The upload could not be completed.'=>'Upakiaji haukuweza kukamilika.','Storage refused the upload (HTTP %d).'=>'Hifadhi imekataa upakiaji (HTTP %d).','Style preset'=>'Mtindo uliowekwa awali','A starting point. Anything below overrides it.'=>'Mahali pa kuanzia. Chochote kilicho hapa chini kinakibatilisha.','Use my own colours and sizes'=>'Tumia rangi na saizi zangu mwenyewe','Leave this off and the preset is used exactly as it is.'=>'Acha hii ikiwa imezimwa na seti ya awali itatumika vile vile ilivyo.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Tazama maelezo ya toleo la Zinn Digital®.','The Zinn® update service did not issue a download link for this update. Check that this site can reach the Zinn® platform, then try again.'=>'Huduma ya kusasisha ya Zinn® haikutoa kiungo cha kupakua kwa ajili ya sasisho hili. Angalia ikiwa tovuti hii inaweza kufikia jukwaa la Zinn®, kisha ujaribu tena.','The update could not be downloaded from the Zinn® update service (%s). Try again in a few minutes.'=>'Sasisho halikuweza kupakuliwa kutoka kwa huduma ya kusasisha ya Zinn® (%s). Jaribu tena baada ya dakika chache.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Sasisho lililopakuliwa limeshindwa kukaguliwa uadilifu wake na halijasakinishwa.']];